CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nPump Up The Volumes Tou
 r\nShe & Him\nMonday\, October 5 | The Castro\n\nShe & Him feature the unl
 ikely pairing of indie folk artist M.Ward and actress/singer/songwriter Zo
 oey Deschanel. Drawing upon analog production techniques and a shared love
  of vintage pop bands\, the duo emerged in 2008 and Volume One\, a collect
 ion of songs that introduced Deschanel as a singer/songwriter in her own r
 ight. The like-minded Volume Two and Volume Three appeared in 2010 and 291
 3\, respectively\, buffered by a pair of whimsical holiday efforts. In 202
 2\, the duo issued Melt Away: A tribute to Brian Wilson\, which saw them t
 ake on a set of Beach Boys and Wilson classics.\n\nWhile starring in the 2
 007 film The Go-Getter\, Deschanel was asked by director Martin Hynes to p
 erform a duet with Ward\, who has agreed to helm the movie’s soundtrack.
  The two recorded a cover of Richard & Linda Thompsons’ “When I Get To
  The Border” and later reconvened in Portland\, Oregon where they began 
 recording Deschanel’s original songs (which the actress had previously d
 emoed for years\, but kept secret) in Ward’s studio. Drawing upon analog
  production techniques and a shared love of vintage pop bands\, the duo em
 erged with Volume One\, a collection of songs that introduced Deschanel as
  a singer/songwriter in her own right.\n\nReleased in March 2008 by Merge 
 and Domino Recording Co\, Volume One received support from a number of cri
 tics\, with Paste Magazine even deeming it the year’s best album. Th...\
 n\nall ages\nSold out\nAnother Planet Entertainment presents: Pump Up The 
 Volumes Tour\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://ticketmaster.evyy.n
 et/c/253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ticketmaster.
 com%2Fshe-him-san-francisco-california-10-05-2026%2Fevent%2F1C0064B97D6F46
 2E%3Fcamefrom%3DCFC_ANOTHERPLANET_web%26brand%3Danotherplanet\nDetails: ht
 tps://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/5/she-him-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7619917;-122.4347365
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32422212/888e8d8e-0a1a-4200-aa85-f1b2c1b5760c.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:The Castro\, 429 Castro St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94114
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/5/she-him-tickets
