BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:San Francisco Ballet Orchestra Concertmaster Cordula Merks
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T213000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17846097@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Violinist Cordula Merks has been serving as Concertmaster of t
 he San Francisco Ballet Orchestra since December 2015 after holding the As
 sistant Concertmaster position with the Seattle Symphony and Concertmaster
  roles with Germany's Essen\, Bochum\, and Bergische symphony orchestras.\
 n\nIt's no surprise then\, that Merks' Tomadachi Quartet-Mayumi Wyrick (vi
 olin)\, Amy Hiraga (viola)\, and Peter Wyrick (cello)-brings a high concen
 tration of San Francisco talent to the Conservatory\, with decades of expe
 rience across the Symphony and Ballet Orchestra among them.\n\nMerks' ecle
 ctic program seats contemporary vocal composer Caroline Shaw (Entr'acte\, 
 here arranged for string quartet) alongside George Gershwin (Lullaby) and 
 stalwarts like Leos Janacek (String Quartet No. 2\, Intimate Letters)\, an
 d Antonin Dvorak (String Quartet No. 12 in F Major\, Op. 96\, American).\n
 \nJanacek's Intimate Letters is justly named: On a vacation\, Janacek met 
 and fell deeply in love Kamila Stosslova\, undeterred by their 40-year age
  gap and the fact they were both married. For the next 11 years\, Stosslov
 a essentially functioned as Janacek's muse: He wrote over 700 letters to h
 er-and wrote four operas\, two string quartets\, a mass\, and several orch
 estral works. Interestingly\, most of their correspondence was suppressed 
 by Czechoslovakia until 1990.\n\nDvorak's American\, one of the most popul
 ar string quartets in the canon\, was written while the composer was vacat
 ioning in Spillville\, Iowa\, home to a Czech immigrant commun...\n\nFree\
 nSan Francisco Conservatory of Music\n\nTickets: https://sfcm.edu/\nDetail
 s: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/5/san-francisco-ballet-orchestra-co
 ncertmaster-cordula-merks-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34437115/48b23d1c-6a89-4718-8734-0c783fa67192.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Sol Joseph Recital Hall\, San Francisco Conservatory of Music\, 5
 0 Oak Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/5/san-francisco-ballet-orchestra-c
 oncertmaster-cordula-merks-tickets
END:VEVENT
