 \, and poet Tongo Eisen-Martin—for a live performance of their album “
 Traveling Shoes” inside the exhibition “Dread Scott: The Body Politic.
 ”\n\nMelding jazz\, poetry\, and soulful sounds “Traveling Shoes” ex
 plores Black life\, political consciousness\, community resistance\, and l
 iberation. Music begins promptly at 7pm. Seating limited\, RSVP recommende
