BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mico
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17370141@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:In an era where everyone seemingly wants to blow up overnight\
 , MICO is proof that nothing beats great music and consistency. In late 20
 18\, a 16 year-old Miguel Veloso would sing in Discord servers and Twitch 
 streams to connect with new listeners one-by-one. Now at 21 years old\, MI
 CO’s hard work has paid off in the form of a cult fandom and over 60 mil
 lion global streams all without the aid of a record label.\n\nFor MICO\, t
 he internet isn’t something to be overthought—it’s like his second h
 ome\, organically growing a following of over 750\,000 dedicated “amicos
 ” over the last 5 years. Coming off his radio hit “cut my hair” and 
 sold-out debut show in late 2022\, MICO released his much anticipated EP 
 “the tears we fight” the following September. Followed up by a 3-track
  EP titled “the afterparty” in December\, the sister projects were gen
 erating viral hits like “another soul” and “better”\, with fans co
 ming back for every release.\n\nIn 2023\, MICO sought to break the stigma 
 surrounding online artists by embarking on two tours spanning Canada & the
  US. Selling out a multitude of shows across both countries\, MICO continu
 es to prove the industry wrong\, forcefully becoming one of the main up-an
 d-coming alternative pop artists to breakthrough in recent years.\n\nAnd 2
 024 is showing no signs of stopping for the alt-pop rising phenom\, kickin
 g off the year with his largest show to date at Budweiser Stage in Toronto
 \, and gearing up for a new music era - slated for the Fall - with plans o
 f touring g...\n\nGoldenvoice Presents\n\nTickets: https://tix.axs.com/BTg
 4EgAAAAADWLvAAgAAAAD0%2fv%2f%2f%2fwD%2f%2f%2f%2f%2fC0dvbGRlbnZvaWNlAP%2f%2
 f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f%2f?cid=usaffdostuff\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/
 events/2026/10/13/mico-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
