DESCRIPTION:Goldenvoice Presents\nDom Dolla\nwith DJ Seinfeld b2b HAAi\, S
 kiis b2b Clearcast\n\nFriday\, October 16 | Cow Palace\n\nTHIS EVENT IS 18
 + A valid\, physical government-issued photo ID is required for entry wher
 e applicable and for the purchase of alcohol. School IDs\, expired IDs\, p
 hotos or photocopies of IDs\, and digital IDs will not be accepted for eve
 nt entry or alcohol purchases.\n\nThere are 3 ticket types (Floor\, Bowl\,
  & VIP). The ONLY WAY to access the Floor is by purchasing a Floor ticket 
 and receiving a Floor wristband upon entry.\n\nDOORS OPEN: 7:00 PM\nSHOW: 
 8:00 PM\n\nGrammy nominated DJ\, producer & songwriter\, DOM DOLLA\, is ex
 periencing a meteoric rise\,\nhis signature style of house music is connec
 ting with global audiences\, and he is recognised as\none of the most exci
 ting producers in electronic music.\n\nIn his late teens Dom spent weekend
 s hosting pub discos & djing at parties whilst working as a\ngraphic desig
 ner during the week. Dom was encouraged to quit his day job to pursue his\
 nobsession with music and production.\n\nDom emerged with a string of crit
 ically acclaimed club hits\; Define\, Take It & San Francisco.\nDom then r
 eleased ‘Miracle Maker’ ft. Clementine Douglas which was named BBC Rad
 io 1’s\nHottest Record In The World\, propelling Dom into his global bre
 ak‐out moment with a run of hit\nsingles\, Rhyme Dust w/ MK\, Eat Your M
 an w/ Nelly Furtado\, Saving Up\, girl$\, CAVE w/ Tove Lo\,\nDreamin ft. D
 aya and Don’t Worry Baby’ w/ Tiga\, which has seen Dom’s catalog sur
 pass 1.5\nBILLION str...\n\n18+\nGoldenvoice Presents\nListed time is door
 s\n\nTickets: https://www.axs.com/events/1485548/dom-dolla-tickets?cid=usa
 ffdostuff\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/16/dom-dolla-cow-p
 alace-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
